# Local server secrets for `wrangler dev`.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in what you need.
#
# AI providers are optional: the deterministic wiring engine and local code
# generator work with none of these set.
#
# Gemini (server-side, never exposed to the browser)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
#
# OpenAI fallback
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
# Workers AI model override (the [ai] binding is declared in wrangler.toml)
# WORKERS_AI_MODEL=@cf/meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct-fp8-fast
#
# CORS origin for /api responses (defaults to *)
# ALLOWED_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173
